  - It uses the existing toolkit calls `g.build_invoke`, `g.hygiene_run`, `g.exec_state`, `g.panel_wiring` and `g.op_hygiene_record_path`.
  - It uses `pi_shots_lib`'s `Rec`, `sweep`, `tl`, `restart` and `kill_and_verify`.
  - The first review already confirmed `png_stats` is new (`priorart-op-getbdimage.md:359`).
